 - 2026-06-28: PHASE A1 (ARC NORTH STAR; PRIMARY; HEADLINE) -- STOP PREDICTING change-VALUE; READ IT FROM THE ENV. A change-LOCATION-pruned, REAL-ENV-VALUE-GROUNDED interleaved act-and-observe search on A1's exact held-out games. .451 proved change-VALUE prediction is REPRESENTATION-INVARIANT (3 classes) but change-LOCATION is learnable (cell_recall 0.727). A1 demotes the model from state-predictor to action-PRIOR: per state, the change-LOCATION model ranks WHICH legal actions change something meaningful, the agent EXECUTES the top-k in the REAL env (reset-replay) to read the TRUE next state (change-VALUE for free, never predicted), the learned verifier scores progress to the .437-quality goal, best-first. Measures BOTH north-star axes: ACCURACY (NEVER_ENUMERATED -> COVERED migration / first-win vs 0.04) and EFFICIENCY (actions-to-first-win). The decisive swing + fork that redirects .453. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_env_grounded_search_no_first_win_lift_WALL_DEEPER_THAN_VALUE_PREDICTION; results/experiment_4903_env_grounded_location_pruned_search.json
 - 2026-06-28: PHASE A1b (ARC NORTH STAR; LAST REPRESENTATION SWING) -- LATENT-ACTION INTERFACE (AdaWorld arXiv:2503.18938, D's flagged priority-1). Gated on A1's first-win-NOT-lifted regime (value_grounded_first_win_delta_median < 0.1). Infer latent ACTION tokens from cold ARC transitions, align E3 legal controls to those tokens, and score A1's held-out transitions through the latent-action state -- a structurally-DISTINCT representation (a latent-action interface, NOT another decision-need or action-prefix-delta table). MUST genuinely run live (>60s). Either a DISTINCT representation finally moves change-VALUE, or the gap is representation-invariant across FOUR classes + env-grounding -> .453 escalates. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_latent_action_no_value_lift_representation_invariant_4_classes; results/experiment_4904_latent_action_interface.json
 - 2026-06-28: PHASE A2 (ARC NORTH STAR; LEVEL-UP ATTEMPT GUARANTEE) -- bank >=1 NEW reproducible level on a ROTATED target (rotate OFF .451 dc22 and .450 g50t and .449 s5i5 and .448 r11l; prefer a shallow L2 game with a grounded next-level delta via recommend_approach + dead_ends -- m0r0 L2->L3 / sp80 L2->L3 / su15 L2->L3 / cn04 L2->L3 are strong shallow-deepen candidates; AVOID the hidden-state-bound dead-ends ka59/wa30 and the just-failed dc22). offline_reproduced gated. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_m0r0_no_new_level_residual_duplicate_depth; results/experiment_4905_levelup_attempt.json
